        },
        {
          "text": "Nta ho bīvuganya mu mitima, bat’ Enda twubahe Uhoraho Imana yacu, ni yo iduha imvura y’agatāsi n’iy’ urushana, nk’ukw ibihe bihaye ibindi; ni yo itugerera amayinga yashinzwe yo kwimburiramwo. ",
          "type": "text",
